221:{character:???}West Wind.
222:The player who moves after him is facing us from the side. He is wearing a suit and has a slicked-back hairstyle. He plays a 1 Pin with a confident expression on his face, then we see a guy with a side part hairstyle smack the table hard.
223:Guy with Side Part Hair
224:{character:Guy with Side Part Hair}What's wrong with you? No one plays a 1 Pin after 3 West Winds.
225:Guy with a Crew Cut
226:{character:Guy with a Crew Cut}That's right! You're making trouble on purpose and trying to curse us, aren't you?
227:Guy with Slicked Back Hair
228:{character:Guy with Slicked Back Hair}You have nothing to worry about if you have a clear conscience. Look, the boss hasn't said anything yet.
229:Just as the atmosphere becomes tense after three of the people stand up, the man with his back to us takes a puff of the cigarette in his hand, then he speaks calmly after casually dusting the ashes into the ashtray next to him.
230:{character:???}Is it necessary to talk so much when playing mahjong?
